## Performance investigation (Loveca Labo \'97 tier list / char faces)\
\
Scope: `/Users/kaneko_kai/projects/ll-ocg-tools` \'97 read-only review of `tierListMaker.js`, `memberCharacterIcons.js`, `index.html` boot, and startup asset patterns.\
\
---\
\
### Top 3 most likely causes\
\
#### 1. Char faces default **ON** \uc0\u8594  large image + CPU work in picker and board\
\
**Evidence**\
\
- Unset localStorage \uc0\u8594  faces **ON** (`/Users/kaneko_kai/projects/ll-ocg-tools/js/tierListMaker.js:123-131`).\
- Picker shows up to **400** cards (`65`, `1204-1205`); each cell calls `cardVisualInnerHtml` (`1235-1247`), which when faces are on resolves icons and emits `<img>` (`216-255`, `640-647`).\
- With faces **on**, thumbnail prefetch is **skipped** (`1260-1267`); with faces **off**, `prefetchCatalogListThumbnails` runs for the first 48 (`1261-1266`, `cards.js:414-434`).\
- Live / non-catalog names hit `resolveMemberCharacterIcon`, which can **scan the full roster** (60 entries) per name part (`memberCharacterIcons.js:190-198`); picker filter changes rerun `renderGrid` on every input with **no debounce** (`1287-1289`).\
\
**Scale:** ~60 roster icons with art (`member-character-icons.json` roster 60); `assets/game-icons/member-icons` \uc0\u8776  **2.6\u8239 MB / 99 files**. A full picker grid with faces can mean hundreds of concurrent PNG (or card-thumb fallback) loads.\
\
**Cheap fixes**\
\
- Default **`showCharFaces: false` for card rooms**; keep ON only for character-tier rooms, or \'93opt-in\'94 first visit (`123-131`).\
- When faces off, keep current thumb + prefetch path; when faces on, **cap visible picker** (e.g. 80\'96120) or virtualize.\
- **Debounce** `renderGrid` (150\'96300\uc0\u8239 ms) on `#tierlist-pick-q` and filter selects (`1287-1289`).\
- Cache `resolveCardCharacterIcons(card)` per `card_no` for the picker session; avoid repeated roster scans for live names (index by normalized name in `memberCharacterIcons.js`).\
\
---\
\
#### 2. Presence heartbeat \uc0\u8594  **full room UI refresh** on every Firestore room snapshot (not just board)\
\
**Evidence**\
\
- Presence interval **30s** (`61`, `410-415`); `touchTierListPresence` updates `members.*.lastSeenAt` (`tierListRoomSync.js:744-749`).\
- Room watcher **always** runs `renderLobby`, `renderRoomHeader`, `renderRoomToolbar`, **`renderMembers`**, `renderHostTools` (`434-437`).\
- `renderMembers` replaces **`host.innerHTML`** and re-emits Google **`photoURL` `<img>`** for every member on **each** snapshot (`598-627`), even though board rerender is correctly gated by `roomShellSig` (`439-442`).\
\
With multiple participants, presence updates multiply \uc0\u8594  repeated DOM teardown, layout, and avatar refetch while you drag/sort cards.\
\
**Cheap fixes**\
\
- On room callback, if only `members.*.lastSeenAt` (or stale flags) changed, **update stale CSS / titles** or skip `renderMembers` entirely.\
- Increase `PRESENCE_INTERVAL_MS` (e.g. 60\'9690s) or write presence to a **subcollection** so the main room doc doesn\'92t churn.\
- Presence timer is already paused when tab hidden (`461-474`, `1861-1864`) \'97 good; the main cost is redundant **renderMembers** on visible tab.\
\
---\
\
#### 3. Face toggle (and `faceMode` in `shellSig`) \uc0\u8594  **full board shell remount** + mass image reload\
\
**Evidence**\
\
- `shellSig` includes `faceMode` (`883-895`); mismatch triggers `board.innerHTML = html` and **`chipPool.clear()`** (`908-947`).\
- Checkbox handler calls **`renderBoard()`** directly (`1532-1537`), not an in-place chip update.\
- Reused chips from the pool **do not** refresh inner HTML when face mode changes \'97 only selection class (`991-996`); remount path destroys all nodes and recreates images.\
\
**Cheap fixes**\
\
- Remove **`f0|f1` from `shellSig`**; on toggle, walk existing `.tierlist-card` / `.tierlist-char` and swap innerHTML / classes only.\
- Optionally **`scheduleBoardRender`** for toggle to batch with entry updates (`158-164`).\
- Character picker still does **`grid.innerHTML = matched.map(...)`** on every search keystroke (`1405-1419`, `1427`) \'97 debounce + DOM reuse same as card picker.\
\
---\
\
### `memberCharacterIcons.js` (roster / load count)\
\
| Item | Detail |\
|------|--------|\
| Load at module init | JSON import + roster `Map` build (`6-7`, `46-50`) \'97 small (~10\uc0\u8239 KB JSON), not the main cost |\
| Icons on screen | Tier list drives count: up to **400** (card picker) or **~60** (char picker, `1389-1419`) or **N entries** on board |\
| Paths | `assets/game-icons/member-icons/` via `artifactImageSrc` (`28-31`, `39-44`) |\
| Hot path | Fuzzy `resolveMemberCharacterIcon` **O(roster)** (`190-198`) on live-card names in face mode |\
\
**Cheap fixes:** build a normalized-name \uc0\u8594  entry map once; use `listMemberCharacterRoster()` only when opening char picker, not per chip resolve.\
\
---\
\
### Boot / `index.html` / cache (secondary for \'93whole Labo feels slow\'94)\
\
**Evidence**\
\
- `main.js` **statically imports** `tierListMaker.js` (`/Users/kaneko_kai/projects/ll-ocg-tools/js/main.js:36`) \uc0\u8594  pulls `tierListRoomSync`, `memberCharacterIcons`, JSON manifests, etc. on **every** boot. Contrast: `tournament.js` is **dynamic** import (`982-988`).\
- Import map adds `?v=` from `loveca-build` (`index.html:2919-2962`, `2976-2979`) \'97 busts cache when meta changes; does **not** fetch all listed modules, only the import graph from `main.js`.\
- `initTierListMaker()` runs at startup (`main.js:977-978`); `renderAll()` even off tier view (`tierListMaker.js:1891-1892`) \'97 light when not in room (`renderBoard` bails at `870-875`).\
- `#tierlist=CODE` auto-`enterRoom` at boot (`1885-1888`) \uc0\u8594  immediate Firestore watchers + presence timer.\
\
**Cheap fixes**\
\
- `import("./tierListMaker.js")` only from tier button / hash / `openTierListMaker` (mirror tournament).\
- Defer `initTierListMaker` until first open unless hash has `#tierlist=`.\
\
**Startup assets:** `prefetchGameStatusArtBundledEarly()` preloads ~20 small status PNGs (`gameStatusIcons.js:456-480`) \'97 minor vs tier-list face storm. No evidence tier list prefetches all member icons at boot; cost is **on room + picker + faces ON**.\
\
---\
\
### Quick priority matrix\
\
| Priority | Change | Impact |\
|----------|--------|--------|\
| P0 | Default faces **OFF** (card rooms) | Cuts default network/DOM for most users |\
| P0 | Skip or diff **`renderMembers`** on presence-only room updates | Stops 30s UI churn in multiplayer rooms |\
| P1 | Face toggle **without** `shellSig` remount | Toggle stops nuking the board |\
| P1 | Debounce card/char **picker** `renderGrid` | Typing/filter stops 400\'d7 resolve + DOM |\
| P2 | Dynamic import **tierListMaker** from `main.js` | Faster deck-only sessions |\
\
